+## Practical guidance for agents
+
+If a task is about zbarcam, prefer edits and validation in the path above. Do not start in the language bindings or GUI wrappers unless the issue is specifically about a binding. The core of the behavior lives in the processor and video layers, with `zbarcam` acting as a small orchestration front-end.
